# Real financial data - never commit. This app handles real school
# financial data just like pta_treasurer did, so the same rules apply
# from day one. See tests/fixtures/ and sample_data/ for the one
# deliberate exception: synthetic/anonymized data checked in on purpose.
input/
output/
data/
logs/
